TITLE 100C pH 3 pure water eq with minerals; count aqueous Al species
SOLUTION 1
    temp 100
    pH 3 charge
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    K-mica 0 10
    Kaolinite 0 10
    Dolomite 0 10
    Epsomite 0 10
    Fe(OH)3(a) 0 10
    Halite 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file al_sel.txt
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Al_species_count
10 PUNCH TOT("Al")
END
